.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_ports_list" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_ports_list \- Ports List Data Structure (CNS 1Eh)
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_ports_list {
.br
.BI "    __le64 genctr;"
.br
.BI "    __le16 nument;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 rsvd10[6];"
.br
.BI "    struct nvme_fabrics_transport_entry entries[];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "genctr" 12
Generation Counter (GENCTR)
.IP "nument" 12
Number Entries (NUMENT)
.IP "rsvd10" 12
Reserved
.IP "entries" 12
Underlying Fabrics Transport Entry list, see \fIstruct
nvme_fabrics_transport_entry\fP
